{"actor":{"type":"system"},"content":{"blocks":[{"content":"Web search results for query: \"Claude Code VS Code extension JetBrains hooks settings.json transcript local\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Use Claude Code in VS Code - Claude Code Docs\",\"url\":\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/vs-code\"},{\"title\":\"IDE Integration: VS Code, JetBrains, and Beyond | Developer Toolkit\",\"url\":\"https://developertoolkit.ai/en/claude-code/quick-start/ide-integration/\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Code Features and Settings Reference 2026 | hidekazu-konishi.com\",\"url\":\"https://hidekazu-konishi.com/entry/claude_code_features_settings_reference_2026.html\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Code in VS Code and JetBrains - Angelo Lima\",\"url\":\"https://angelo-lima.fr/en/claude-code-vscode-jetbrains-en/\"},{\"title\":\"From Terminal to IDE: Using Claude Code with Bedrock in VS Code and JetBrains - DEV Community\",\"url\":\"https://dev.to/gunnargrosch/from-terminal-to-ide-using-claude-code-with-bedrock-in-vs-code-and-jetbrains-3gbn\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Code IDE Setup for VS Code and JetBrains (2026) | Fastio\",\"url\":\"https://fast.io/resources/claude-code-ide-extensions-guide/\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Code VS Code extension: a complete guide (2026) | eesel AI\",\"url\":\"https://www.eesel.ai/blog/claude-code-vs-code-extension\"},{\"title\":\"Integrating Claude Code Plugin with VSCode & JetBrains: Ultimate Guide\",\"url\":\"https://skywork.ai/blog/integrating-claude-code-plugin-vscode-jetbrains-ultimate-guide/\"},{\"title\":\"From Terminal to IDE: Using Claude Code with Bedrock in VS Code and JetBrains | AWS Builder Center\",\"url\":\"https://builder.aws.com/content/39i6DBwGPD99bTEPa5PIBiSSmFB/from-terminal-to-ide-using-claude-code-with-bedrock-in-vs-code-and-jetbrains\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Code: The Complete Guide (Skills, Hooks, Commands & MCP)\",\"url\":\"https://learnwithhasan.com/claude-code-guide/\"}]\n\nBased on the web search results, here's what I found about Claude Code, VS Code extension, JetBrains, hooks, and settings.json:\n\n## Settings Configuration\n\nBoth VS Code and JetBrains extensions read the same settings.json tree as the CLI, so permissions, hooks, and mcpServers apply uniformly. Configuration is shared via the same ~/.claude/settings.json file.\n\n## VS Code Settings Location\n\nIn VS Code Settings (Cmd+,), settings live under the claudeCode.* namespace, so you should search by the full key (e.g. claudeCode.initialPermissionMode) if you edit the JSON directly.\n\n## Hooks Configuration\n\nClaude Code settings can be configured to customize allowed commands, hooks, and more. PreToolUse runs before every tool execution and receives the tool name and tool input on stdin.\n\n## JetBrains Integration\n\nThe JetBrains plugin works differently from VS Code - instead of being a standalone extension, it's a wrapper around the CLI, and you run claude from the IDE's integrated terminal where the plugin detects it and adds IDE integration features.\n\n## Local vs. Shared Settings\n\nSettings keys are read by the harness from settings.json files at user, project, and local scope, providing flexibility in how you configure Claude Code across different levels of your development environment.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks.","tool_use_id":"toolu_01ET4irJzYiFgPMKHy1KE3E9","type":"tool_result"}],"role":"user"},"context":{"branch":"main","cwd":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/conversation-ledger","head":"de79e501289e2e19946780867779ef465ead2124","repo":"git@github.com:evintunador/conversation-ledger.git"},"conversation":{"id":"claude-code:700cd82f-2f79-4cd6-b727-0f81230e0837#agent:a4fc099b2ea3fc467","parent":"claude-code:700cd82f-2f79-4cd6-b727-0f81230e0837","seq":16},"id":"ev1-301291ddc7684d2b793fba3afc4e2893155efdfa14c998c0c2de530a131f4974","kind":"conversation_turn","occurred_at":"2026-07-18T23:22:13.349Z","producer":{"session_id":"700cd82f-2f79-4cd6-b727-0f81230e0837","