{"actor":{"type":"system"},"content":{"blocks":[{"content":"Web search results for query: \"Claude Code desktop app settings.json hooks ~/.claude/projects transcripts\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Explore the .claude directory - Claude Code Docs\",\"url\":\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/claude-directory\"},{\"title\":\"claude-code-best-practice/best-practice/claude-settings.md at main · shanraisshan/claude-code-best-practice\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/shanraisshan/claude-code-best-practice/blob/main/best-practice/claude-settings.md\"},{\"title\":\"claude-howto/06-hooks/README.md at main · luongnv89/claude-howto\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/luongnv89/claude-howto/blob/main/06-hooks/README.md\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Code Hooks: Complete Guide to All 12 Lifecycle Events\",\"url\":\"https://claudefa.st/blog/tools/hooks/hooks-guide\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Code Features and Settings Reference 2026 | hidekazu-konishi.com\",\"url\":\"https://hidekazu-konishi.com/entry/claude_code_features_settings_reference_2026.html\"},{\"title\":\"Automate Your AI Workflows with Claude Code Hooks | Butler's Log\",\"url\":\"https://blog.gitbutler.com/automate-your-ai-workflows-with-claude-code-hooks\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Code settings.json Hooks: Auto-Run Scripts at Every Step — Vincent's Blog\",\"url\":\"https://blog.vincentqiao.com/en/posts/claude-code-settings-hooks/\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - disler/claude-code-hooks-mastery: Master Claude Code Hooks · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/disler/claude-code-hooks-mastery\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Code Hooks (2026): Block Claude Reading .env + 30 Hook Events, JSON Input, Exit Codes\",\"url\":\"https://www.morphllm.com/claude-code-hooks\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Code settings.json: Copy-Paste Templates for env, model, auth & More — Vincent's Blog\",\"url\":\"https://blog.vincentqiao.com/en/posts/claude-code-settings-misc/\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's information about Claude Code desktop app settings.json, hooks, and the ~/.claude directory structure:\n\n## ~/.claude Directory and Project Structure\n\nBeyond the config you author, ~/.claude holds data Claude Code writes during sessions. These files are plaintext. Anything that passes through a tool lands in a transcript on disk: file contents, command output, pasted text.\n\nIf you go into ~/.claude/projects you can see a list of every project where you've run Claude Code. Inside each project directory is a transcript file for every session you've done.\n\n## Settings.json and Configuration Files\n\nWhere Claude Code reads CLAUDE.md, settings.json, hooks, skills, commands, subagents, workflows, rules, and auto memory. Most users only edit CLAUDE.md and settings.json.\n\nGlobal-scope files live in ~/.claude/ and apply across all projects.\n\n## Hooks Configuration\n\nHooks intercept Claude Code events and execute shell commands or LLM prompts. Both extensions read the same settings.json tree as the CLI, so permissions, hooks, and mcpServers apply uniformly.\n\nHooks are configured in the settings.json file. For example, the hooks would be added to ~/.claude/settings.json like: { \"hooks\": { \"Stop\": [ { \"matcher\": \"\", \"hooks\": [ { \"type\": \"command\", \"command\": \"osascript...\" } ] } ] } }\n\n## Transcripts Storage\n\nNumber of days to retain chat transcripts. Defaults to 30 days. Transcripts older than this value are automatically deleted. Transcripts and history are not encrypted at rest. OS file permissions are the only protection.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks.","tool_use_id":"toolu_01Trn5CmqDdfvtaEQZo9vVoE","type":"tool_result"}],"role":"user"},"context":{"branch":"main","cwd":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/conversation-ledger","head":"de79e501289e2e19946780867779ef465ead2124","repo":"git@github.com:evintunador/conversation-ledger.git"},"conversation":{"id":"claude-code:700cd82f-2f79-4cd6-b727-0f81230e0837#agent:a4fc099b2ea3fc467","parent":"