{"actor":{"type":"system"},"content":{"blocks":[{"content":"Web search results for query: \"Codex CLI hooks notify config.toml 2026 agent-turn-complete\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Codex CLI Agent Notifications: Desktop Alerts, Audio Chimes, and Multi-Agent Monitoring | Codex Knowledge Base\",\"url\":\"https://codex.danielvaughan.com/2026/04/10/codex-cli-agent-notifications-desktop-alerts-monitoring/\"},{\"title\":\"Codex CLI Guide 2026: Setup, Sandbox, AGENTS.md & MCP\",\"url\":\"https://blakecrosley.com/guides/codex\"},{\"title\":\"Hooks | ChatGPT Learn\",\"url\":\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/hooks\"},{\"title\":\"Advanced Configuration | ChatGPT Learn\",\"url\":\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/config-advanced\"},{\"title\":\"Codex CLI - Symposium\",\"url\":\"https://symposium.dev/design/agent-details/codex-cli.html\"},{\"title\":\"Configuration Reference | ChatGPT Learn\",\"url\":\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/config-reference\"},{\"title\":\"Codex CLI in 2026: What’s New, What’s Changed and What’s Coming | Codex Knowledge Base\",\"url\":\"https://codex.danielvaughan.com/2026/03/27/codex-cli-in-2026-whats-new/\"},{\"title\":\"Codex CLI config.toml: Every Key Explained\",\"url\":\"https://ofox.ai/blog/codex-cli-config-toml-deep-dive/\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found relevant information about Codex CLI hooks, the notify config, and the agent-turn-complete event in 2026. Here's what I found:\n\n## Notification Configuration in config.toml\n\nCodex CLI ships with two complementary notification mechanisms configured via config.toml. The [tui] section controls in-terminal alerts that fire when the TUI window is not focused, with a notifications key that accepts either a boolean (true enables all events) or an array of specific event names.\n\n## Agent-Turn-Complete Event\n\nAs of April 2026, Codex supports two notification event types: agent-turn-complete — fires when the agent finishes a turn and is waiting for input. \n\n## The notify Hook\n\nThe notify hook can be configured in config.toml to send notifications to external scripts, for example: notify = [\"/bin/bash\", \"/Users/you/.codex/hooks/notify.sh\"].\n\n## Current Limitations\n\nAs of April 2026, there are known gaps in the notification system: no subagent-specific events — the notify hook fires only for agent-turn-complete on the parent session.\n\nThis configuration allows you to route agent-turn-complete notifications to custom scripts or desktop alerts via the notify hook mechanism in your Codex CLI config.toml file.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks.","tool_use_id":"toolu_01AZ7d7jnzio7XT6wUkxzdYR","type":"tool_result"}],"role":"user"},"context":{"branch":"main","cwd":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/conversation-ledger","head":"de79e501289e2e19946780867779ef465ead2124","repo":"git@github.com:evintunador/conversation-ledger.git"},"conversation":{"id":"claude-code:700cd82f-2f79-4cd6-b727-0f81230e0837#agent:aff74f1a10dad039e","parent":"claude-code:700cd82f-2f79-4cd6-b727-0f81230e0837","seq":49},"id":"ev1-19721423844b68f55b17d2a0b5902438fd553f2c1ac2a12dc8731afe71ab8cd2","kind":"conversation_turn","occurred_at":"2026-07-18T22:36:39.001Z","producer":{"session_id":"700cd82f-2f79-4cd6-b727-0f81230e0837","source":"claude-code","source_version":"2.1.214","tool":"cledger","version":"0.20.0"},"raw":{"data":{"agentId":"aff74f1a10dad039e","cwd":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/conversation-ledger","entrypoint":"cli","gitBranch":"main","isSidechain":true,"message":{"content":[{"content":"Web search results for query: \"Codex CLI hooks notify config.toml 2026 agent-turn-complete\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Codex CLI Agent Notifications: Desktop Alerts, Audio Chimes, and Multi-Agent Monitoring | Codex Knowledge Base\",\"url\":\"https://codex.danielvaughan.com/2026/04/10/codex-cli-agent-notifications-desktop-alerts-monitoring/\"},{\"title\":\"Codex CLI Guide 2026: Setup, Sand