{"actor":{"type":"system"},"content":{"blocks":[{"content":"Web search results for query: \"Codex macOS app config.toml hooks ~/.codex/sessions rollout files\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Configuration Reference | ChatGPT Learn\",\"url\":\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/config-reference\"},{\"title\":\"Codex CLI Config Location: ~/.codex Paths (Mac/Linux/Win) | Inventive HQ\",\"url\":\"https://inventivehq.com/knowledge-base/openai/where-configuration-files-are-stored\"},{\"title\":\"Codex CLI config.toml: Every Key Explained\",\"url\":\"https://ofox.ai/blog/codex-cli-config-toml-deep-dive/\"},{\"title\":\"codex_hooks do not fire in interactive sessions when configured via repo-local .codex/config.toml · Issue #17532 · openai/codex\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/17532\"},{\"title\":\"Developer commands | ChatGPT Learn\",\"url\":\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/cli/reference\"},{\"title\":\"Advanced Configuration | ChatGPT Learn\",\"url\":\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/config-advanced\"},{\"title\":\"Codex CLI Guide 2026: Setup, Sandbox, AGENTS.md & MCP\",\"url\":\"https://blakecrosley.com/guides/codex\"},{\"title\":\"Config basics | ChatGPT Learn\",\"url\":\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/config-basic\"},{\"title\":\"codex/docs/config.md at main · openai/codex\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/openai/codex/blob/main/docs/config.md\"},{\"title\":\"Hooks no longer run after Codex Desktop update · Issue #21639 · openai/codex\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/21639\"}]\n\nI found search results related to Codex's macOS app configuration. Here's what the search revealed:\n\n## Configuration Structure\n\nCodex stores its configuration in ~/.codex/, which includes config.toml for global configuration settings, auth.json for credentials, history.jsonl for command/session history, and sessions/ directory organized by year/month/day containing rollout-*.jsonl session transcript files.\n\n## Hooks Configuration\n\nYou can keep hooks in a sidecar hooks.json file, or inline them under [hooks] in config.toml. Codex can load lifecycle hooks from either hooks.json files or inline [hooks] tables in config.toml files that sit next to active config layers.\n\nHooks can be defined inline in TOML using the same event structure as hooks.json, with supported events including PreToolUse, SessionStart, and others.\n\n## Session Rollout Files\n\nSession rollout files are stored at ~/.codex/sessions/YYYY/MM/DD/ with names like rollout-2025-01-22T10-30-00-abc123.jsonl, containing complete conversation history.\n\n## Project Trust and Hooks\n\nProject-local hooks load only when the project .codex/ layer is trusted.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks.","tool_use_id":"toolu_01U7BEQCW9URKk4JJNr9Dwno","type":"tool_result"}],"role":"user"},"context":{"branch":"main","cwd":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/conversation-ledger","head":"de79e501289e2e19946780867779ef465ead2124","repo":"git@github.com:evintunador/conversation-ledger.git"},"conversation":{"id":"claude-code:700cd82f-2f79-4cd6-b727-0f81230e0837#agent:a4fc099b2ea3fc467","parent":"claude-code:700cd82f-2f79-4cd6-b727-0f81230e0837","seq":14},"id":"ev1-28ffe29364526e72c86b33b22eb3a14ffbbea31fd431aad27b52154b28e73192","kind":"conversation_turn","occurred_at":"2026-07-18T23:22:10.370Z","producer":{"session_id":"700cd82f-2f79-4cd6-b727-0f81230e0837","source":"claude-code","source_version":"2.1.214","tool":"cledger","version":"0.20.0"},"raw":{"data":{"agentId":"a4fc099b2ea3fc467","cwd":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/conversation-ledger","entrypoint":"cli","gitBranch":"main","isSidechain":true,"message":{"content":[{"content":"Web search results for query: \"Codex macOS app config.toml hooks ~/.codex/sessions rollout files\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Configuration Reference | ChatGPT Learn\",\"url\":\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/config-reference\"},{\"title\":\"Codex CLI Con