{"actor":{"type":"system"},"content":{"blocks":[{"content":"Web search results for query: \"Continue.dev dev data telemetry chat history storage open source\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"GitHub - continuedev/continue: open-source coding agent · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/continuedev/continue\"},{\"title\":\"Telemetry - Continue - Docs\",\"url\":\"https://docs.continue.dev/customize/telemetry\"},{\"title\":\"Continue Development Insights | Restackio\",\"url\":\"https://www.restack.io/p/continue-answer-development-cat-ai\"},{\"title\":\"🧑‍💻 Development data | Continue\",\"url\":\"https://docs.continue.dev/development-data\"},{\"title\":\"continue-dev-vscode-plugin/docs/docs/telemetry.md at main · evaisse/continue-dev-vscode-plugin\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/evaisse/continue-dev-vscode-plugin/blob/main/docs/docs/telemetry.md\"},{\"title\":\"Continue — Ship as fast as you code\",\"url\":\"https://docs.continue.dev/telemetry\"},{\"title\":\"Telemetry - Continue Documentation\",\"url\":\"https://docs.continue.dev/advanced/telemetry\"},{\"title\":\"Continue.dev Deep Dive: Open-Source AI Coding 2026\",\"url\":\"https://www.digitalapplied.com/blog/continue-dev-deep-dive-open-source-ai-coding-assistant-2026\"},{\"title\":\"Continue - Docs\",\"url\":\"https://docs.continue.dev/\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found about Continue.dev regarding telemetry, chat history storage, and open-source aspects:\n\n## Open Source\nContinue is a pioneering open-source coding agent available as a CLI, a VS Code extension, and a JetBrains plugin. Continue.dev is an Apache 2.0 extension where you decide every layer via a single config.yaml.\n\n## Telemetry\nAll data collected by the open-source Continue extensions is anonymized and stripped of personally identifiable information (PII) before being sent to PostHog. You can opt out of telemetry collection at any time if you prefer not to share your usage information.\n\nThis included removing anonymous telemetry, pulling out authentication, squashing bugs, and more. Additionally, the telemetry can be switched off in one config flag.\n\n## Development Data & Chat History Storage\nWhen you use Continue, you automatically collect data on how you build software. By default, this development data is saved to .continue/dev_data on your local machine. When combined with the code that you ultimately commit, it can be used to improve the LLM that you or your team use (if you allow).\n\n## Privacy & Self-Hosting\nContinue.dev wins on transparency, on the ability to route between Anthropic, OpenAI, Ollama, vLLM, and any OpenAI-compatible provider. Every layer — chat, edit, autocomplete, embeddings, indexing — can run against a local or on-prem endpoint. The extension does not require any hosted dependency to function, and the telemetry can be switched off in one config flag.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks.","tool_use_id":"toolu_019G7wFqzJBTkNo97Uvs3k6u","type":"tool_result"}],"role":"user"},"context":{"branch":"main","cwd":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/conversation-ledger","head":"de79e501289e2e19946780867779ef465ead2124","repo":"git@github.com:evintunador/conversation-ledger.git"},"conversation":{"id":"claude-code:700cd82f-2f79-4cd6-b727-0f81230e0837#agent:af424cc63295b8016","parent":"claude-code:700cd82f-2f79-4cd6-b727-0f81230e0837","seq":27},"id":"ev1-1196b76c5d663b035dda665594e741a893b01107017c67b71951167d27493dd4","kind":"conversation_turn","occurred_at":"2026-07-18T22:13:37.043Z","producer":{"session_id":"700cd82f-2f79-4cd6-b727-0f81230e0837","source":"claude-code","source_version":"2.1.214","tool":"cledger","version":"0.20.0"},"raw":{"data":{"agentId":"af424cc63295b8016","cwd":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/conversation-ledger","entrypoint":"cli","gitBranch":"main","isSidechain":true,"message":{"content":[{"content":"Web search results for query: \"Continue.dev dev data telemetry chat history 