{"actor":{"type":"system"},"content":{"blocks":[{"content":"Web search results for query: \"Cursor agent local transcript store hooks session history\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Cursor 3.11: Side Chats and Agent Transcript Search\",\"url\":\"https://www.digitalapplied.com/blog/cursor-3-11-side-chats-agent-transcript-search-2026\"},{\"title\":\"Overview | Cursor Docs\",\"url\":\"https://cursor.com/docs/agent/overview\"},{\"title\":\"Local IDE agent chats and the Agent CLI still use separate session stores - Feature Requests - Cursor - Community Forum\",\"url\":\"https://forum.cursor.com/t/local-ide-agent-chats-and-the-agent-cli-still-use-separate-session-stores/165486\"},{\"title\":\"What Does Cursor Store on Your Machine? A Deep Dive into ~/.cursor/ and state.vscdb — vibe-replay\",\"url\":\"https://vibe-replay.com/blog/cursor-local-storage/\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - jazzyalex/agent-sessions: Local-first macOS app to browse, search, analyze, and resume supported AI coding-agent session history across Codex, Claude Code, OpenCode, Cursor Agent, Hermes, OpenClaw, Copilot CLI, and more. · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/jazzyalex/agent-sessions\"},{\"title\":\"Hooks | Cursor Docs\",\"url\":\"https://cursor.com/docs/hooks\"},{\"title\":\"Agent Sessions - Codex, Claude, Antigravity, Copilot Local History\",\"url\":\"https://jazzyalex.github.io/agent-sessions/\"},{\"title\":\"Deep Dive into the new Cursor Hooks | Butler's Log\",\"url\":\"https://blog.gitbutler.com/cursor-hooks-deep-dive\"},{\"title\":\"Agent Sessions - local session browser for Cursor CLI and other CLI agents - Built for Cursor - Cursor - Community Forum\",\"url\":\"https://forum.cursor.com/t/agent-sessions-local-session-browser-for-cursor-cli-and-other-cli-agents/160231\"},{\"title\":\"cursor-agent-learning/.cursor/hooks/example-session-start.sh at main · wchen02/cursor-agent-learning\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/wchen02/cursor-agent-learning/blob/main/.cursor/hooks/example-session-start.sh\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found about Cursor agent local transcript storage, hooks, and session history:\n\n## Local Transcript Storage\n\nCursor's local data includes transcripts, SQLite chat stores, global state blobs, checkpoints, and editor history. Specifically:\n\n- IDE chats live in the editor index / agent-transcripts (composer/conversation id), while CLI chats live under ~/.cursor/chats and resume via cursor-agent --resume\n- Cursor Agent transcripts can be browsed from Cursor's local storage, enriched with Cursor chat metadata when available\n\n## Hooks for Session Management\n\nCursor 3.11 adds durable parallel side chats, local search across your agent transcript history, and new cloud-agent hooks. However, there's an important limitation: MCP hooks (beforeMCPExecution, afterMCPExecution) do not fire in cloud agents, and the session-lifecycle pair (sessionStart/sessionEnd) and workspaceOpen are tied to the IDE's lifetime and simply have no cloud equivalent.\n\nYou can use hooks for things like storing session transcripts to automatically keep all the transcripts of everything you've done in Cursor somewhere, and there is a hooks output channel in Cursor that will give you debugging information, accessible by going to \"Output channels\" and choosing \"Hooks\".\n\n## Session History Access\n\nCursor 3.11 adds local search across your agent transcript history, making it easier to find past conversations.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks.","tool_use_id":"toolu_014UqAhHtAcrcS3z9SsWCoA1","type":"tool_result"}],"role":"user"},"context":{"branch":"main","cwd":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/conversation-ledger","head":"de79e501289e2e19946780867779ef465ead2124","repo":"git@github.com:evintunador/conversation-ledger.git"},"conversation":{"id":"claude-code:700cd82f-2f79-4cd6-b727-0f81230e0837#agent:a4fc099b2ea3fc467","parent":"claude-code:700cd82f-2f79-4cd6-b727-0f81230e08