{"actor":{"type":"system"},"content":{"blocks":[{"content":"Web search results for query: \"\"codex\" CLI \"hooks.json\" OR \"features.hooks\" changelog release notes stop hook\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Hooks | ChatGPT Learn\",\"url\":\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/hooks\"},{\"title\":\"Improve Codex CLI release management: changelogs, prerelease notes, docs sync, and migration examples · Issue #21682 · openai/codex\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/21682\"},{\"title\":\"Hooks no longer run after Codex Desktop update · Issue #21639 · openai/codex\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/21639\"},{\"title\":\"Codex CLI - Symposium\",\"url\":\"https://symposium.dev/design/agent-details/codex-cli.html\"},{\"title\":\"Codex CLI Guide 2026: Setup, Sandbox, AGENTS.md & MCP\",\"url\":\"https://blakecrosley.com/guides/codex\"},{\"title\":\"Hooks — Codex Plugin Marketplace\",\"url\":\"https://www.codex-marketplace.com/hooks\"},{\"title\":\"Codex CLI Changelog — changelogs.info\",\"url\":\"https://changelogs.info/codex-cli/changelog/\"},{\"title\":\"Codex hooks just gave you back complete control over your code. | by JP Caparas | AI @ Sulat.com\",\"url\":\"https://ai.sulat.com/codex-hooks-just-gave-you-back-complete-control-over-your-code-57d044bcae1b?gi=cbdf5b9d3ae7\"},{\"title\":\"Codex CLI | ChatGPT Learn\",\"url\":\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/cli\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found about Codex CLI hooks configuration and the Stop hook event:\n\n## Hooks Configuration\n\nIf a single layer contains both hooks.json and inline hooks, Codex merges them and warns at startup. By default, Codex looks for hooks/hooks.json inside the plugin root, but a plugin manifest can override that default with a hooks entry in .codex-plugin/plugin.json.\n\n## Configuration Key Changes\n\nIn Codex CLI 0.129.0, the CLI now warns that [features].codex_hooks is deprecated and that users should use [features].hooks instead. This was raised as a concern about release management, with documentation needing to be synchronized with changelog updates.\n\n## Stop Hook Event\n\nStop runs at turn scope, meaning it executes when a chat turn completes. For the Stop event, { \"decision\": \"block\", \"reason\": \"Run tests again\" } tells Codex to create a continuation prompt — it does not reject the turn.\n\n## Hook Events Evolution\n\nAt one time, the system had only two events: SessionStart and Stop. PR #14626 brought UserPromptSubmit, and PreToolUse arrived alongside PostToolUse around v0.117.0.\n\n## Stability\n\nAs of v0.124.0 (April 23, 2026) the hooks engine is stable, and new hook events still ship in releases.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks.","tool_use_id":"toolu_01CMS84zY2ZC9LDS8HgEZF8u","type":"tool_result"}],"role":"user"},"context":{"branch":"main","cwd":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/conversation-ledger","head":"de79e501289e2e19946780867779ef465ead2124","repo":"git@github.com:evintunador/conversation-ledger.git"},"conversation":{"id":"claude-code:700cd82f-2f79-4cd6-b727-0f81230e0837#agent:aff74f1a10dad039e","parent":"claude-code:700cd82f-2f79-4cd6-b727-0f81230e0837","seq":65},"id":"ev1-fd1ebe56f1aa2a39c4cc000648edf93a66041b0d2a4b314b22aca8650d5f75ec","kind":"conversation_turn","occurred_at":"2026-07-18T22:37:42.451Z","producer":{"session_id":"700cd82f-2f79-4cd6-b727-0f81230e0837","source":"claude-code","source_version":"2.1.214","tool":"cledger","version":"0.20.0"},"raw":{"data":{"agentId":"aff74f1a10dad039e","cwd":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/conversation-ledger","entrypoint":"cli","gitBranch":"main","isSidechain":true,"message":{"content":[{"content":"Web search results for query: \"\"codex\" CLI \"hooks.json\" OR \"features.hooks\" changelog release notes stop hook\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Hooks | ChatGPT Learn\",\"url\":\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/hooks\"},{\"title\":\"Improve Codex CLI rel