aider.llm.history`) using the `AIDER_LLM_HISTORY_FILE` environment variable.\n\n**Restoring Previous Sessions:**\n- There's an option to restore previous chat history messages (default: False) via the `AIDER_RESTORE_CHAT_HISTORY` setting.\n\n## History Management\n\nYou can run the `/history` command to open history.md where all the chat history (requests and LLM responses) can be selected or unselected by a markdown checkbox.\n\n## Sharing Chat Logs\n\nYou can copy the markdown logs you want to share from `.aider.chat.history.md` and make a GitHub gist, or publish the raw markdown logs on the web any way you'd like.\n\nRegarding \"hooks\" specifically—the search results don't contain explicit information about session log hooks or plugin/hook mechanisms for the chat history feature.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks.","tool_use_id":"toolu_01J1o3WVLXQJnoiwAa8jhzwU","type":"tool_result"}],"role":"user"},"context":{"branch":"main","cwd":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/conversation-ledger","head":"de79e501289e2e19946780867779ef465ead2124","repo":"git@github.com:evintunador/conversation-ledger.git"},"conversation":{"id":"claude-code:700cd82f-2f79-4cd6-b727-0f81230e0837#agent:a4fc099b2ea3fc467","parent":"claude-code:700cd82f-2f79-4cd6-b727-0f81230e0837","seq":65},"id":"ev1-76184397b93b94e17667a7ae81d0ca6b4eda15fcdf10e561df643954ca938e28","kind":"conversation_turn","occurred_at":"2026-07-18T23:23:36.894Z","producer":{"session_id":"700cd82f-2f79-4cd6-b727-0f81230e0837","source":"claude-code","source_version":"2.1.214","tool":"cledger","version":"0.20.0"},"raw":{"data":{"agentId":"a4fc099b2ea3fc467","cwd":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/conversation-ledger","entrypoint":"cli","gitBranch":"main","isSidechain":true,"message":{"content":[{"content":"Web search results for query: \"aider chat history .aider.chat.history.md session log hooks\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Options reference | aider\",\"