{"actor":{"type":"system"},"content":{"blocks":[{"content":"Web search results for query: \"git-bug git-appraise git notes architecture store issues in git\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"GitHub - git-bug/git-bug: Distributed, offline-first bug tracker embedded in git · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/git-bug/git-bug\"},{\"title\":\"Git Bug: Distributed, Offline-First Bug Tracker Embedded in Git, with Bridges | Hacker News\",\"url\":\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=43971620\"},{\"title\":\"Git Notes: git's coolest, most unloved­ feature (2022) | Lobsters\",\"url\":\"https://lobste.rs/s/vmrnyd/git_notes_git_s_coolest_most_unloved\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - dspinellis/git-issue: Git-based decentralized issue management · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/dspinellis/git-issue\"},{\"title\":\"google/git-appraise | DeepWiki\",\"url\":\"https://deepwiki.com/google/git-appraise\"},{\"title\":\"Distributed code-reviews and issues (#14121) · Issues · GitLab.org / GitLab · GitLab\",\"url\":\"https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/gitlab/-/issues/14121\"},{\"title\":\"Store Code Discussions in Git using Git Notes ~ Wouter J\",\"url\":\"https://wouterj.nl/2024/08/git-notes\"},{\"title\":\"Git - git-bugreport Documentation\",\"url\":\"https://git-scm.com/docs/git-bugreport\"}]\n\nBased on the web search results, here's information about these Git-based tools for managing issues and their architectural approaches:\n\n## Git-Bug\n\nGit-bug manages issues, users, and comments directly within your repository, leveraging Git's decentralized architecture to work offline and sync seamlessly later. Git-bug, written in Go, is a distributed bug tracker embedded in git.\n\n## Git-Appraise\n\nGit-Appraise provides a distributed code review system that works directly with Git repositories by storing all review data as JSON objects in Git notes, eliminating the need for centralized servers while providing a complete code review workflow. \n\nThe architecture uses Git notes under the refs/notes/devtools/* namespace, with each item written as a single line of JSON, allowing Git's \"cat_sort_uniq\" strategy to automatically merge notes.\n\n## Git Notes\n\nGit notes puts data in the `refs/notes/` namespace (specifically in `refs/notes/commits`). Git notes allow adding extra information to a commit after you've created it, and are useful when you want to preserve the existing Git object but add extra data, with a many-to-one relationship where one Git object can have multiple Git notes referencing it.\n\n## Related Projects\n\nGit-issue is a decentralized issue management system based on Git, storing issues as simple text files within the repository rather than in notes.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks.","tool_use_id":"toolu_017yt1ENEs5QNjEm7XWXPpQU","type":"tool_result"}],"role":"user"},"context":{"branch":"main","cwd":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/conversation-ledger","head":"de79e501289e2e19946780867779ef465ead2124","repo":"git@github.com:evintunador/conversation-ledger.git"},"conversation":{"id":"claude-code:700cd82f-2f79-4cd6-b727-0f81230e0837#agent:af424cc63295b8016","parent":"claude-code:700cd82f-2f79-4cd6-b727-0f81230e0837","seq":16},"id":"ev1-62ae4c75b6fd9493bb881735dbf02ae29760be2d18eea38a0de4307fbd8031ec","kind":"conversation_turn","occurred_at":"2026-07-18T22:13:16.965Z","producer":{"session_id":"700cd82f-2f79-4cd6-b727-0f81230e0837","source":"claude-code","source_version":"2.1.214","tool":"cledger","version":"0.20.0"},"raw":{"data":{"agentId":"af424cc63295b8016","cwd":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/conversation-ledger","entrypoint":"cli","gitBranch":"main","isSidechain":true,"message":{"content":[{"content":"Web search results for query: \"git-bug git-appraise git notes architecture store issues in git\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"GitHub - git-bug/git-bug: Distributed, offline-first bug tracker embedded in git · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/git-bug/git-b