{"actor":{"type":"system"},"content":{"blocks":[{"content":"Web search results for query: \"store AI chat transcript in git notes refs/notes provenance commit linked\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"GitHub - mandel-macaque/memento: Keep track of you codex sessions per commit · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/mandel-macaque/memento\"},{\"title\":\"Stop Losing AI Context! Git AI Tracks Every Generated Line\",\"url\":\"http://prompts.brightcoding.dev/blog/stop-losing-ai-context-git-ai-tracks-every-generated-line\"},{\"title\":\"Introducing Agent Note: saving the why behind AI-assisted code in Git - DEV Community\",\"url\":\"https://dev.to/wasabeef/introducing-agent-note-saving-the-why-behind-ai-assisted-code-in-git-30a8\"},{\"title\":\"git-memento-note-comment - GitHub Marketplace\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/marketplace/actions/git-memento-note-comment\"},{\"title\":\"using-git-notes-for-a... - Agent Skill by msewell | SkillsMP\",\"url\":\"https://skillsmp.com/skills/msewell-agent-stuff-skills-using-git-notes-for-ai-context-skill-md\"},{\"title\":\"How Git AI Works | Git AI\",\"url\":\"https://usegitai.com/docs/cli/how-git-ai-works\"},{\"title\":\"git-ai | Ry Walker Research | Ry Walker\",\"url\":\"https://rywalker.com/research/git-ai\"},{\"title\":\"Git Notes Management | acunniffe/git-ai | DeepWiki\",\"url\":\"https://deepwiki.com/acunniffe/git-ai/8.4-git-notes-management\"},{\"title\":\"Git Notes Unraveled: History, Mechanics, and Practical Uses - DEV Community\",\"url\":\"https://dev.to/shrsv/git-notes-unraveled-history-mechanics-and-practical-uses-25i9\"},{\"title\":\"Git AI - Track AI Code all the way to production\",\"url\":\"https://usegitai.com/changelog\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found several tools and approaches for storing AI chat transcripts in Git notes with provenance tracking linked to commits:\n\n## Key Tools and Approaches\n\n**git-memento** — A Git extension that records the AI coding session used to produce a commit and attaches AI conversation transcripts as git notes, creating an audit trail for AI-assisted development. It carries both refs/notes/commits and refs/notes/memento-full-audit.\n\n**Agent Note** — A tool where agent hooks save the conversation and session info, and when you run `git commit`, a Git hook links the session to the commit through Agent Note's git note for that commit, with the permanent record living in refs/notes/agentnote.\n\n**Git AI** — An open-source tool where attribution lives in git notes under refs/notes/ai, and when you commit, Git AI consolidates checkpoints into an authorship log and attaches it to the new commit as a git note in refs/notes/ai. It intercepts AI agent activity through editor hooks, captures attribution metadata, and stores it using Git Notes (an established git feature for adding metadata without polluting commit history).\n\n## Git Notes Mechanics\n\nGit notes and trailers form a zero-infrastructure metadata layer for AI agent context, with notes attaching post-hoc metadata without changing commit SHAs. Notes live in a separate namespace (refs/notes/), don't affect commit hashes, and can be shared selectively via fetch/push.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks.","tool_use_id":"toolu_012nNiXt6rhUQqJydGhXNUC2","type":"tool_result"}],"role":"user"},"context":{"branch":"main","cwd":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/conversation-ledger","head":"de79e501289e2e19946780867779ef465ead2124","repo":"git@github.com:evintunador/conversation-ledger.git"},"conversation":{"id":"claude-code:700cd82f-2f79-4cd6-b727-0f81230e0837#agent:af424cc63295b8016","parent":"claude-code:700cd82f-2f79-4cd6-b727-0f81230e0837","seq":29},"id":"ev1-3bd62147a80a662fd1c0f0549b186acbe198479ce8d8d943db693f0a47874d58","kind":"conversation_turn","occurred_at":"2026-07-18T22:13:37.160Z","producer":{"session_id":"700cd82f-2f79-4cd6-b727-0f81230e0837","source":"claude-code","source_version":"2.1.214","tool":"cledger